{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>內地股市反覆調整，寧德時代顯著受壓。</p><p></p><p>上證綜合指數結束過去三日升勢。深圳創業板指數先升後回落，連跌第八日。滬深京三市成交不足1.5萬億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>寧德時代A股急挫近一成二，是歷來最大單日跌幅。</p><p></p><p>電池產業鏈相關股份亦受壓。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T09:21:08.910741+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T10:57:53.708718+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:17:41.390429+00:00","content_hash":"0796dbda5af9940db7a741450aa575bbaeb18a99fad2595b725421522c553ce2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}